["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Naveen Rao: 4D Computing, AI&#x27;s Energy Wall &amp; Beating Biology dynamical systems theory von Neumann architecture sparsity Jevons paradox 4D computing state space trajectory\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-allin-ai-三年内会撞上能源墙-解法是造一台不像计算机的计算机/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/77b757da5faf27af-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">22:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>AI 三年内会撞上能源墙，解法是造一台不像计算机的计算机</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Google 一家公司每月消耗 3.2 千万亿 token，按每 token 10 焦耳算就是 12 吉瓦，而全美数据中心总功率约 40 吉瓦。Naveen Rao 认为这个缺口只能靠换掉计算机的底层范式来填。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">芯片架构</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The World is Running Out of Fuel strategic petroleum reserves tank bottoms dark fleet resin\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-wsjournal-战略储备快见底-油价危机才真正开始/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fc66680f65b8e859-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">20:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Journal</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>战略储备快见底，油价危机才真正开始</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">过去半年油价没失控，靠的是战略储备、被制裁石油和中国少买这三块缓冲垫；现在三块都在被抽干，真正的冲击才要传导到柴油和物价上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">能源</span><span class=\"tag\">油价</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI Safety Language Is Destroying the Debate | Steven Sinofsky alignment telemetry CVE OPSEC SevOne, PriOne\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-a16z-ai-安全语言正在毁掉监管讨论-那是-bug-不是恶魔/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">29:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>AI 安全语言正在毁掉监管讨论：那是 bug，不是恶魔</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把 AI 出错说成「未对齐」，等于给软件加上意图和道德判断，让国会和公众无法理解到底发生了什么——它本该被当作 bug 来调试、上报和修复。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>15</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">软件工程</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"How to Make a Difference: Part 1 learned helplessness explanatory style learned optimism agency axial age\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-hiddenbrain-乐观不是性格-是一套可以练的解释风格/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bda02344d4b647e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">48:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Hidden Brain</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>乐观不是性格，是一套可以练的解释风格</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">无助是学来的，乐观也是。决定人是否放弃的不是打击本身，而是他把打击解释成永久、普遍、还是自己的错。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">心理学</span><span class=\"tag\">习得性无助</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Robert Moses and the Shaping of New York, Part 1 eminent domain parkway slum clearance Works Progress Administration\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-stuffmissed-他从未当选任何公职-却重塑了整座纽约/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">41:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>他从未当选任何公职，却重塑了整座纽约</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Robert Moses 靠任命职位叠加权力，用公园和高速公路改写纽约，也把种族偏见写进了城市肌理——他的遗产至今仍在被争论。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">城市治理</span><span class=\"tag\">基础设施</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Miranda Fricker on Blame communicative blame reactive attitude apology stance epistemic blame\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-phibites-责备不是报复-哲学家主张我们该少责备一点/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/243c92b44ec40dbb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">23:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Philosophy Bites</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>责备不是报复：哲学家主张我们该少责备一点</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Miranda Fricker 认为报复式责备没有道理，最有价值的责备是「沟通式责备」——目的是让对方真正理解自己行为的道德意义，达成共享的道德理解。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">道德哲学</span><span class=\"tag\">责备</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The current balance of power in open models open-weight distillation ATOM Project AAII KYC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-interconnects-中国开源权重模型领先-蒸馏只解释一两个月差距/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e33c5f20c0d489db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">17:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>中国开源权重模型领先，蒸馏只解释一两个月差距</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中国模型在下载量和基准上全面领先，但蒸馏只解释一到两个月差距，真正原因是发布节奏和任务聚焦；美国公司正靠中国模型做产品。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">中美竞争</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"368 | Elizabeth Alexander on Why Democracy Needs Imagination close reading Ars Poetica Hawks Nest mine disaster Mellon Foundation free people read freely\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-mindscape-诗歌不是民主的点缀-而是民主的支柱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d69097efcbd03611-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Mindscape</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>诗歌不是民主的点缀，而是民主的支柱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">禁书和规定老师不能教什么，跟查禁新闻一样是在动言论自由的根；一个集体是谁、看重什么，全靠语言成形——艺术是民主的基础设施，不是它的海报。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">诗歌</span><span class=\"tag\">人文学科</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Death of Reading (with James Marriott) post-literate society Republic of Letters Reading Revolution sitzfleisch\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-econtalk-识字率曾让欧洲民主化-如今却在倒退/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8da698e33560635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">EconTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>识字率曾让欧洲民主化，如今却在倒退</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">书写把人类交流从情绪化、面对面的口头文化，冷却成讲证据、讲逻辑的文本文化；识字率上升曾推动民主革命，而屏幕正在把公共话语拉回前识字时代。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">阅读</span><span class=\"tag\">媒介理论</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Carlo Rovelli: complexity and value anapaestic decameter iambic pentameter Bloomsbury Group friction\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-startweek-一杯水没有终极真相-量子力学逼我们放弃单一视角/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8fc04a8d1e9204fb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">42:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Start the Week</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>一杯水没有终极真相：量子力学逼我们放弃单一视角</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">物理学家 Carlo Rovelli 说，量子力学最深的启示不是新粒子，而是启蒙时代那个「独立于观察者的唯一客观现实」的梦不成立——现实是互相丰富、但不收敛的多种视角。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">量子力学</span><span class=\"tag\">科学哲学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Can CEO John Ternus find Apple&#x27;s next big thing? Hotel California Apple Silicon Cook Doctrine\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-decoder-苹果没有自己的前沿模型-却想靠折叠屏再赢一次/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bc9368ca7d5e1e5f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">58:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Decoder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>苹果没有自己的前沿模型，却想靠折叠屏再赢一次</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Ternus 首秀讲的是智能个人中枢，但整场发布会没有一项新的 AI 功能；苹果的 AI 靠 Google 模型撑着，而它真正的赌注押在折叠屏和一堆还没影的新品类上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">苹果</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 硬件</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ellen Correia Golay on All-to-All Trading and Treasury Market Liquidity all-to-all trading off-the-run principal trading firms (PTFs) central clearing cheapest to deliver agent clearing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-macromusings-美债市场真正的瓶颈-不是规模-是中间商不够用了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/236f8c497eab5e75-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">47:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Macro Musings</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>美债市场真正的瓶颈：不是规模，是中间商不够用了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一级交易商的资产负债表早已跟不上美债存量的增速，做市商让位给高频交易商，但后者在2020年3月集体撤退——这才是美债流动性问题的核心。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美债</span><span class=\"tag\">市场结构</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"This is how you rule the world pre-idea funding SAFE check Tree Hacks duck syndrome wantrepreneur\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-grayarea-斯坦福有一门秘密课程-教12个人如何从他人身上提取价值/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7c8b1deddea1e240-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">58:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Gray Area</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>斯坦福有一门秘密课程，教12个人如何从他人身上提取价值</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这门课不写进课程目录，每年只收 12 人，由一位硅谷 CEO 教怎么从人身上提取价值。作者说，学生撒谎不是意外，而是这套机制长期奖励的结果。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硅谷</span><span class=\"tag\">斯坦福</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How LA Is Quietly Becoming America&#x27;s New Industrial Tech Hub fourth turning vertical integration lights out digital twin CapEx\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-oddlots-美国制造业空心化不是能力问题-是金融回报问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">36:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>美国制造业空心化不是能力问题，是金融回报问题</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Chris Power 说美国把工业政策当对冲基金的财务报表来管，中国把工业政策当国家安全来管；关税只是不完美的纠偏工具，核心是让美国消费者不再补贴对手的工业能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">再工业化</span><span class=\"tag\">制造业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Banza: Brian Rudolph. The Chickpea Pasta That Nearly Turned to Mush elimination diet glyphosate Detox Project natural channel\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-howibuilt-把鹰嘴豆意面煮成糊后-他靠-像泡茶一样泡-活了下来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aedd4aae43a50f3c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">58:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">How I Built This</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>把鹰嘴豆意面煮成糊后，他靠「像泡茶一样泡」活了下来</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Banza 的第一次规模化生产全线失败，20,000 盒意面一煮就烂。他们没销毁，而是贴上一张「像泡茶一样泡」的贴纸发货——因为不发货就永远失去这个零售商。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费品</span><span class=\"tag\">食品创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"20VC: Why AI Cannot Replace Humans in Enterprise | Why Work Processes Not Models Will Be The Most Valuable Asset in AI | Why Europe Has Lost and Building in the US vs EU with Daniel Dines, UiPath map of work cartography credentialed middle vibe coding\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-twentyvc-ai-不会取代人-取代人的是没被写下来的工作/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c70932bbba8f0291-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">20VC</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>AI 不会取代人，取代人的是没被写下来的工作</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型可以互换，真正值钱的是企业把工作流程写成手册——这份「工作地图」才是 AI 时代不可替代的资产，也是企业自己训练模型的唯一前提。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业AI</span><span class=\"tag\">自动化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Hemp-THC businesses are bracing for a near total ban full-spectrum CBD Delta-8 economies of scale California sober\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-indicator-大麻合法州也躲不过-联邦禁令要清空-thc-货架/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">8:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Indicator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>大麻合法州也躲不过：联邦禁令要清空 THC 货架</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2018 年农业法案的漏洞让 hemp 衍生 THC 长成 280 亿美元产业，如今国会要堵上它——连大麻合法的州也会因为失去便宜替代品而涨价。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">监管</span><span class=\"tag\">大麻</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ep. 400: Dennett Rejects Qualia (Part Two) qualia heterophenomenology Cartesian theater Umwelt / Innenwelt panpsychism philosophical zombie\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-pel-蝙蝠自己也不知道当蝙蝠是什么感觉/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/32cd9ba9b1ae4d6b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Partially Examined Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>蝙蝠自己也不知道当蝙蝠是什么感觉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">蝙蝠论证靠的是一个永远无法通达的私有内核；Dennett 说这个内核根本不存在，蝙蝠对自己也不是一种「感觉起来像什么」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">意识哲学</span><span class=\"tag\">感受质</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Rise and Fall of the Ming Dynasty Kaogong Ji dogong hutong feng shui\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-historyhit-北京中轴线不是古迹-是仍在运转的城市操作系统/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/647317f0dd4bb22e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">55:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>北京中轴线不是古迹，是仍在运转的城市操作系统</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">明朝按两千年前的《考工记》蓝图重建北京，中轴线至今决定这座两千万人城市的对称与生长，连奥运鸟巢都建在这条线上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">城市规划</span><span class=\"tag\">中轴线</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Germany’s Chancellor Has No Authority Left Volksparteien AfD Die Linke SED\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-goodfight-德国基民盟跌出州议会-中间派时代已经结束/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>德国基民盟跌出州议会：中间派时代已经结束</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">基民盟在梅前州得票不到5%，建国以来首次被挡在州议会门外。默茨权威已失，而民粹极左极右在35岁以下选民中拿下压倒性多数。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">德国政治</span><span class=\"tag\">民粹主义</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"239. 对话卫哲｜中国品牌出海，为什么“选择”比“努力”更重要？ tokenized 价性比 四个单一 产品3.0\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-beiwanglu-出海别等做大了再去欧美-先去欧美才能做大/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c56ff7e702000290-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"贝\"><span class=\"dur\">50:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">贝望录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>出海别等做大了再去欧美，先去欧美才能做大</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">卫哲说，很多公司以为做大了才去欧美，其实正好反了——你去欧美才能做大。地区选择错了，后面的产品3.0、渠道金字塔都搭不起来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出海</span><span class=\"tag\">跨境电商</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"275.AI办公的热闹还没散，个人Agent的战争已经开始｜拆解Town、Instinct、Grok Bot与Muse Personal Agent harness MCP Browser Use Computer Use context\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-luanfanshu-10万用户估值100亿-个人agent的估值跑在产品前面/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/369180a93673e434-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"乱\"><span class=\"dur\">2:06:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">乱翻书</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>10万用户估值100亿：个人Agent的估值跑在产品前面</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Instinct 用户不到 10 万、产品还没正式上线，估值半年从 5000 万美金涨到 100 亿美金——这一轮个人 Agent 的热度里，资本抢船票的成分大于真实需求。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">个人Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">AI创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"10 Years, 10 Lessons: Everything I Got Wrong About Parenting RIE authoritative parenting authoritarian parenting Special Time Gottman method\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-parentmojo-育儿十年才懂-孩子不听话时-问题不在孩子身上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">49:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>育儿十年才懂：孩子不听话时，问题不在孩子身上</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">播客十周年，主持人复盘十条自己曾深信不疑的育儿观念——从强迫孩子吃药到把专家框架当真理，每条都是先在书里学一遍、再在真实冲突里重学一遍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育儿</span><span class=\"tag\">亲子关系</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"897: Intergenerational Space Travel Gen Alpha walk-up song\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-tal-npr-评论区被当成机器人-其实是一群初中生/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b461c033eddd711d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">This American Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>NPR 评论区被当成机器人，其实是一群初中生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">NPR 员工看到评论区一堆乱码，第一反应是机器人并举报；一个年轻同事认出那是被家长屏蔽社交媒体的孩子，把 Spotify 评论区当群聊用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">代际差异</span><span class=\"tag\">平台行为</span>\n</div></div></a>"]